Dialogue: 1,0:05:33.38,0:05:37.70,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k48}{\kf18}Sie {\kf22}ist {\kf12}mit {\kf10}der {\kf30}Einheit {\kf18}nicht {\kf20}der {\kf16}Länge\N{\kf20}nach {\kf80}messbar, {\kf26}sondern {\kf22}nur {\kf18}über {\kf12}die {\kf60}Fläche,
