Dialogue: 1,0:06:39.24,0:06:42.30,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k62}{\kf25}Darum {\kf40}frage {\kf18}er {\kf10}nur {\kf26}und\N{\kf48}behaupte {\kf20}selbst {\kf57}nichts.
