Dialogue: 1,0:10:57.93,0:11:00.40,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\kf44}und {\kf20}in {\kf22}beiden {\kf30}halten {\kf18}wir\N{\kf26}unsere {\kf44}Eindrücke {\kf20}für {\kf23}wahr.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.93,0:11:00.40,Naechste,,0,0,0,,Die Theorie hat eine elegante Antwort.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:00.40,0:11:03.12,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k74}{\kf11}Die {\kf36}Theorie {\kf26}hat {\kf20}eine {\kf42}elegante {\kf63}Antwort.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.40,0:11:03.12,Naechste,,0,0,0,,Der gesunde Sokrates und der kranke Sokrates sind, streng genommen,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:03.12,0:11:07.71,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k56}{\kf9}Der {\kf38}gesunde {\kf62}Sokrates {\kf36}und {\kf16}der {\kf34}kranke\N{\kf50}Sokrates {\kf72}sind, {\kf16}streng {\kf70}genommen,
