Dialogue: 1,0:11:35.57,0:11:39.57,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\kf10}will {\kf8}er {\kf14}das {\kf20}Kind {\kf22}nun {\kf14}im {\kf30}Kreis {\kf76}herumtragen,\N{\kf8}um {\kf14}zu {\kf52}prüfen, {\kf10}ob {\kf14}es {\kf15}ein {\kf31}Windei {\kf27}ist.
