Dialogue: 1,0:12:25.98,0:12:29.63,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k80}{\kf13}Er {\kf30}wirft {\kf22}sich {\kf34}vor, {\kf28}wie {\kf16}ein\N{\kf58}Wortverdreher {\kf18}zu {\kf66}argumentieren,
