Dialogue: 1,0:13:54.44,0:13:58.30,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\kf16}würde {\kf16}er {\kf14}uns {\kf20}beide {\kf34}hart {\kf86}tadeln,\N{\kf18}wieder {\kf70}untertauchen {\kf84}und {\kf26}davonlaufen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.44,0:13:58.30,Naechste,,0,0,0,,Trifft das Argument?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:58.30,0:14:00.04,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k80}{\kf24}Trifft {\kf18}das {\kf52}Argument?
